Package: TamuScDSC
Title: Modular Single-Cell Preprocessing, QC and Doublet Detection
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Selim", "Romero", email = "ssromerogon@tamu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("CaiLab & ChapkinLab", role = "cph"))
Description: Atomic, order-free, re-runnable building blocks for the
    preprocessing stage of a single-cell RNA-seq pipeline. Accepts three
    starting points interchangeably (one merged Seurat object, per-sample
    checkpoint files, or a preloaded list of objects) by normalizing them to a
    common per-sample list. Provides light and stringent QC, a dual-caller
    doublet engine (DoubletFinder + scDblFinder) with consensus and cluster-level
    review, DecontX ambient correction, SCEVAN, Harmony/IntegrateLayers
    integration, an extensible marker registry, and two shipped recipes.
